  <description>Blue competition cone: total height 0.63 m, square base 0.28 x 0.28 m (rule dimensions). Geometry is byte-identical to cone_red (shared STL), only the material differs. Origin: centre of the base bottom face (pose z=0 stands on the ground). static=true - test-only, cannot validate push/displacement penalties.</description>
</model>
